title: rosetta_tools
abstract: "Shared tooling for the Rosetta interpretability research program.
  Provides activation extraction, CAZ metric computation, Procrustes alignment,
  directional ablation, GEM construction, and model/concept registry for
  cross-architecture mechanistic interpretability research."
